{"title": "Unusual Skull", "pageid": 28680, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Unusual_Skull", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Skull_A_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Skull_A_Icon.webp/300px-Skull_A_Icon.webp, /w/images/9/95/Skull_A_Icon.webp 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Unusual Skull image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Skull_A_Icon.webp/300px-Skull_A_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/95/Skull_A_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>A skull sitting on a shelf. Interacting does nothing unless a party member has been sent to prison, at which point it will speak with this party member, calling itself Marvin, and serve as a method for escaping prison.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The top of this skull is cracked with a lattice of shallow fractures.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 250 kg (500 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 250 kg (500 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p>When speaking to Marvin the skull as a prisoner it offers the party two riddles before allowing them to escape.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Riddle 1: <i>I fly but not through the sky. I say goodbye at night and hello in the morning. I am part of you, and follow you wherever you go. I wear only black and run from the light. Yet without it, I couldn't exist.</i>\n<ul><li>Answer: A Shadow.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li>Riddle 2: <i>I am beaten and battered, but never break. My crown has felt the strike of endless blades, yet I can never move. I never sweat, even when the summertide sun shines upon me. Who am I?</i>\n<ul><li>Answer: An Anvil</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>Possible outcomes of playing riddles with the skull are:\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>Both riddles solved.</b> Marvin teleports the imprisoned party member out of the cell, placing them next to the Evidence chests, and casts on them <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haste\" title=\"Haste\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/30px-Haste_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/40px-Haste_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Haste\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haste\" title=\"Haste\">Haste</a> <i>and</i> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Invisibility\" title=\"Greater Invisibility\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp/20px-Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp/30px-Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp/40px-Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Greater Invisibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp/20px-Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Invisibility\" title=\"Greater Invisibility\">Greater Invisibility</a>, both for 10 turns.</li>\n<li><b>Only one riddle solved correctly.</b> Marvin teleports the imprisoned party member out of the cell, next to the entrance to the guardroom, and casts on them <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haste\" title=\"Haste\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/30px-Haste_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/40px-Haste_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Haste\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haste\" title=\"Haste\">Haste</a> <i>and</i> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mirror_Image\" title=\"Mirror Image\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Mirror_Image_Icon.webp/20px-Mirror_Image_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Mirror_Image_Icon.webp/30px-Mirror_Image_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Mirror_Image_Icon.webp/40px-Mirror_Image_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mirror Image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Mirror_Image_Icon.webp/20px-Mirror_Image_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Mirror_Image_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mirror_Image\" title=\"Mirror Image\">Mirror Image</a>, both for 10 turns.</li>\n<li><b>None of the riddles solved.</b> Marvin teleports the imprisoned party member out of the cell, next to the entrance to the guardroom, and casts on them <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haste\" title=\"Haste\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/30px-Haste_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/40px-Haste_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Haste\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haste\" title=\"Haste\">Haste</a> only, for 10 turns.</li></ul>\n<p>In any possible outcome, all party members also get the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fugitive_(Condition)\" title=\"Fugitive (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Fugitive_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Fugitive_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Fugitive_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Fugitive_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Fugitive_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Fugitive_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fugitive\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Fugitive_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Fugitive_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Fugitive_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fugitive_(Condition)\" title=\"Fugitive (Condition)\">Fugitive</a> debuff for 20 turns, causing the guards to attack. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a shelf in a cell in <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Prison\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Prison\">Wyrm's Rock Prison</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In order to interact with the skull, the character must use the context menu and select the interaction default option as <i>pick up</i>.</li>\n<li>Marvin describes his reason for being imprisoned as a \"Bacchanalian\" night of debauchery, a term referring to real-world Roman festivals hosted in the honour of the real-world god Bacchus (greek = Dionysos).</li>\n<li>Marvin can be examined using the following <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcana\" title=\"Arcana\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Arcana_Icon.png/25px-Arcana_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Arcana_Icon.png/38px-Arcana_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Arcana_Icon.png/50px-Arcana_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcana\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Arcana_Icon.png/25px-Arcana_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Arcana_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcana\" title=\"Arcana\">Arcana</a> check:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[ARCANA]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Examine the skull. What magic is at work?</i>&nbsp;(DC 15)</span></li></ul></li>\n<li>The skull cannot be picked up.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714210650\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2620/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24038/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10114/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1025746/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.841      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   43.841      1 -total\n 39.96%   17.517     11 Template:Icon_text\n 33.35%   14.620      8 Template:Icon_link\n 30.